    "Result": "The journey of a plastic bottle.I'm a plastic bottle. A week ago I was full of water. Then a woman bought me at the supermarket and took me home. The next morning the woman drank the water and threw me into a rubbish bin. A street cleaner found me. He put me into a truck. There were a lot of other bottles in the truck. The truck took us to a factory. Some people cleaned us and put us into a big machine.We became small pieces.Finally, they made us into a piece of cloth. Look at your t shirt.Does it look like a plastic bottle?",
